<urn:usf:basis-axis:core-manifest-digest> <urn:usf:predicate:nonClaim> "Manifest movement stales only work whose read closure includes a moved source. A manifest is source selection, so a source the work never reads cannot stale it." <urn:usf:graph:realisation-basis> .
<urn:usf:basis-axis:product-manifest-digest> <urn:usf:predicate:nonClaim> "Same rule as the core manifest axis: selection is not dependency. This is why a new manifest lane can be added beside an existing one without staling its cohort." <urn:usf:graph:realisation-basis> .
<urn:usf:basis-axis:evidence-set-identity> <urn:usf:predicate:nonClaim> "The evidence set is an output of the basis, not an input to it. It moves whenever a verdict is admitted, and invalidating evidence because evidence changed would never terminate." <urn:usf:graph:realisation-basis> .
<urn:usf:realisation-identity:v2:1> <urn:usf:predicate:nonClaim> "Narrow invalidation is the point. Invalidating every verdict whenever any axis moves would be easier to implement and would make reproving meaningless, because a verdict that is always stale is never trusted." <urn:usf:graph:realisation-basis> .
<urn:usf:realisation-identity:v2:1> <urn:usf:predicate:nonClaim> "The identity is resolvable, not stored. Every member is derived from tracked authority or from an observed artefact, so a stale copy of the basis cannot become the basis." <urn:usf:graph:realisation-basis> .
<urn:usf:realisation-identity:v2:1> <urn:usf:predicate:nonClaim> "Resolving a basis grants no authority. It says what is being realised; whether any work may proceed is still decided by construction eligibility, evidence and proof." <urn:usf:graph:realisation-basis> .
<urn:usf:type:SourceIdentity> <urn:usf:predicate:objective> "The exact commit and tree of a product repository under realisation." <urn:usf:graph:realisation-basis> .
<urn:usf:type:BuildArtefact> <urn:usf:predicate:objective> "A built output set identified by the digest of its bytes." <urn:usf:graph:realisation-basis> .
<urn:usf:type:EnvironmentBinding> <urn:usf:predicate:objective> "The vendor-specific resolution of delivery contracts for one environment." <urn:usf:graph:realisation-basis> .
<urn:usf:type:ConfigurationIdentity> <urn:usf:predicate:objective> "The digest of the non-secret configuration given to a runtime." <urn:usf:graph:realisation-basis> .
<urn:usf:type:EvidenceSet> <urn:usf:predicate:objective> "The set of verdicts admitted against one basis." <urn:usf:graph:realisation-basis> .
<urn:usf:type:ExternalFactSnapshot> <urn:usf:predicate:objective> "Facts observed outside the repository at a point in time." <urn:usf:graph:realisation-basis> .
<urn:usf:type:DependencyClosure> <urn:usf:predicate:objective> "A resolved transitive resource closure." <urn:usf:graph:realisation-basis> .
<urn:usf:type:BasisAxis> <urn:usf:predicate:objective> "One independently movable dimension of a realisation basis." <urn:usf:graph:realisation-basis> .
<urn:usf:type:GraphManifest> <urn:usf:predicate:objective> "A declared selection of graph sources, with its imports." <urn:usf:graph:realisation-basis> .
